#7600
The Holiday Zone~
   RavenMUD goes through holidays each year.  Unfortunately, each Immortal
thinks it is their duty to create holiday mobiles, mobs, triggers, you name it,
in each and every zone of RavenMUD.  This makes things extremely confusing for
new Immortals that wish to use existing "stuff" for a new year.  Therefore, I
have created this area so any holiday related items, mobiles, triggers,
objects, and rooms have a nice home.    

Zone 76: Spans 00 - 99. Room Allocation Chart
01-10 - Mob Chute
11-30 - Christmas
31-40 - Thanksgiving
41-50 - Halloween
51-80 - Define New Holidays
81-99 - Currently Reserved

Zone Created 12.21.06
~
