#7613
Lair of the &02Grinch&00~
   This lair has been carved right out of the icy plains above you.  
Everything is covered with a light powdered snow.  In the left corner is a
throne carved out of a granite block.  The lair has a stench that assaults your
sense of smell.  Bones litter the floor and in the far corner of the cave is a
half eaten carcass of a Christmas elf.  A pine tree sits in the middle of the
room.  It is completely devoid of any type of decoration, perhaps someone
forgot about Christmas?    
~
76 524904 4 0 0 0 255 0
