#7614
Entrance to a Lair~
   This tunnel has been completely carved out from the icy tundra.  It slopes
steadily down to a smooth plain.  A strange stench wafts through the air as you
near the northern end of the tunnel.  Other than the smell, it is completely
void of any other details that give a clue as to where it leads.    
~
